WEBVTT

00:00:00.155 --> 00:00:01.830
Most AI dumps code.

00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:03.630
A good tutor asks first: who

00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:05.680
uses it, what breaks first, how

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:06.830
will you test it.

00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:08.843
Then checks you, checkpoint by checkpoint.

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:12.982
Answers you build stick.

00:00:13.483 --> 00:00:15.137
The Socratic way, in Placiq.
